# The image builds its own dependencies and artifacts; anything the host already
# has must not ride along in the build context. node_modules in particular would
# overwrite the linux/$TARGETARCH install from the deps stage with host-arch
# native binaries, and pocketbase/pocketbase would replace the downloaded
# PocketBase binary with the host's.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
pocketbase/pocketbase
pocketbase/pb_data
data
.git
.github
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
